Keep reporting a compacted conversation after the turn that compacted it. The
flag was reset when an agent invocation ended, so in multi-turn mode a compaction
in turn one stopped being reported from turn two on, even though every later turn
is still working from the compacted context. Only a conversation reset clears it
now, since that replaces the transcript with an empty one. The key the agent span
writes by hand, which `LocalAgentInvocation` has no field for, is a named constant
so it cannot drift from the one util-genai writes on chat spans.
